From eed7369d5e6f94bd4a184f1f894e04ac52919547 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
by: triplecN
Subject: [PATCH 06/20] network hardening, timestamp rules,
 Shunko relay

Larger block-download timeouts for Tor, a 10-minute future-block limit, and
the Shunko one-shot transaction hand-over (shunkobroadcast).
